menu "Application"

config APP_JOINT_TEST
    bool "T5+T6 joint motion test (real motor, runs on boot)"
    default n
    help
        Enables the T5 (TMC2209) + T6 (step_engine) joint motion test.
        Runs automatically on boot after all subsystems are up.
        The motor physically moves — 12V motor supply required.
        Phases: A (forward 2 rev trapezoid), B (reverse back to 0),
        C (slow long move with '!' immediate stop via UART1).

endmenu
